    "action": {
      "type": "SET_CONTENT",
      "input": {
        "content": "# versioning operations on document models are not implemented\n\nThe document model operation taxonomy includes a \"Versioning\" category, but it is explicitly marked as not implemented. Do not use any versioning-related operations \u2014 they will fail or produce undefined behavior.\n\nThis is a known gap in the current system. Version management for document models must be handled through other means (e.g., git versioning of the source files).\n\n---\n\nTopics:\n- [[gotchas]]\n- [[architecture decisions]]",
        "updatedAt": "2026-08-13T13:23:35.000Z"
      },
      "timestampUtcMs": "2026-08-13T13:23:35.000Z"
    }
